]},{"id":11,"speaker":"dante","text":"\"Ciacco,\" I answered, \"your wretchedness\nweighs on me so heavily it makes me want to weep.\nBut tell me, if you know—what will happen\nto the citizens of our divided city?\nIs there anyone just there? And tell me\nwhy so much discord has torn it apart.","startTime":159.92,"endTime":176.4,"words":[{"word":"\"Ciacco,\"","start":160.005,"end":161.045},{"word":"I","start":161.045,"end":161.205},{"word":"answered,","start":161.205,"end":162.165},{"word":"\"your","start":162.165,"end":162.565},{"word":"wretchedness","start":162.565,"end":163.205},{"word":"weighs","start":163.205,"end":163.525},{"word":"on","start":163.525,"end":163.685},{"word":"me","start":163.685,"end":164.005},{"word":"so","start":164.005,"end":164.325},{"word":"heavily","start":164.325,"end":164.725},{"word":"it","start":164.725,"end":164.885},{"word":"makes","start":164.885,"end":165.125},{"word":"me","start":165.125,"end":165.285},{"word":"want","start":165.285,"end":165.445},{"word":"to","start":165.445,"end":165.685},{"word":"weep.","start":165.685,"end":166.725},{"word":"But","start":166.725,"end":166.885},{"word":"tell","start":166.885,"end":167.125},{"word":"me,","start":167.125,"end":167.525},{"word":"if","start":167.525,"end":167.685},{"word":"you","start":167.685,"end":167.845},{"word":"know—what","start":167.845,"end":168.765},{"word":"will","start":168.765,"end":168.965},{"word":"happen","start":168.965,"end":169.245},{"word":"to","start":169.245,"end":169.365},{"word":"the","start":169.365,"end":169.525},{"word":"citizens","start":169.525,"end":169.965},{"word":"of","start":169.965,"end":170.085},{"word":"our","start":170.085,"end":170.245},{"word":"divided","start":170.245,"end":170.725},{"word":"city?","start":170.725,"end":171.525},{"word":"Is","start":171.525,"end":171.725},{"word":"there","start":171.725,"end":171.965},{"word":"anyone","start":171.965,"end":172.445},{"word":"just","start":172.445,"end":172.645},{"word":"there?","start":172.645,"end":173.445},{"word":"And","start":173.445,"end":173.605},{"word":"tell","start":173.605,"end":173.765},{"word":"me","start":173.765,"end":174.085},{"word":"why","start":174.085,"end":174.325},{"word":"so","start":174.325,"end":174.485},{"word":"much","start":174.485,"end":174.805},{"word":"discord","start":174.805,"end":175.365},{"word":"has","start":175.365,"end":175.525},{"word":"torn","start":175.525,"end":175.725},{"word":"it","start":175.725,"end":175.845},{"word":"apart.","start":175.845,"end":176.4}]},{"id":12,"speaker":"ciacco","text":"After long struggle, they'll come to bloodshed. The party of the woods\nwill drive out the other with great violence.\nBut then within three years that side will fall,\nand the other will rise again\nthrough the power of one who now waits on the sidelines.\nThey'll hold their heads high for a long time,\nkeeping their enemies under heavy burdens,\nno matter how much the others weep and rage.\nOnly two men are just, and no one listens to them.\nEnvy and pride and greed—\nthese are the three sparks that have set every heart on fire.","startTime":176.4,"endTime":214.4,"words":[{"word":"After","start":176.4,"end":176.8},{"word":"long","start":176.8,"end":177.2},{"word":"struggle,","start":177.2,"end":178},{"word":"they'll","start":178,"end":178.36},{"word":"come","start":178.36,"end":178.56},{"word":"to","start":178.56,"end":178.72},{"word":"bloodshed.","start":178.72,"end":180.08},{"word":"The","start":180.08,"end":180.24},{"word":"party","start":180.24,"end":180.56},{"word":"of","start":180.56,"end":180.68},{"word":"the","start":180.68,"end":180.8},{"word":"woods","start":180.8,"end":181.2},{"word":"will","start":181.2,"end":181.44},{"word":"drive","start":181.44,"end":181.84},{"word":"out","start":181.84,"end":182},{"word":"the","start":182,"end":182.2},{"word":"other","start":182.2,"end":182.4},{"word":"with","start":182.4,"end":182.72},{"word":"great","start":182.72,"end":183.12},{"word":"violence.","start":183.12,"end":